{#- Harmonised notice on the statutory warranty (FAGG §4 (1) Z 12 + Anhang II, Implementing
    Regulation (EU) 2025/1960): the official EU graphic, unaltered and in colour. Shipped by core
    (`src/assets/legal/`, served at /assets/legal/); German for de, English otherwise. Two lossless
    PNG widths (600/1200) via srcset — no WebP/eleventy-img: the graphic must stay unaltered.
    The image carries a short alt; the full official text follows visually hidden, with the QR
    code's link, so the notice is fully available without seeing the graphic. -#}
{%- set _lgLocale = page.lang or coreConfig.defaultLocale -%}
{%- set _lgLang = 'de' if _lgLocale == 'de' else 'en' -%}
<figure class="legal-guarantee-notice">
  <img
    src="/assets/legal/legal-guarantee-notice-{{ _lgLang }}-600.png"
    srcset="/assets/legal/legal-guarantee-notice-{{ _lgLang }}-600.png 600w, /assets/legal/legal-guarantee-notice-{{ _lgLang }}-1200.png 1200w"
    sizes="(min-width: 44rem) 40rem, 100vw"
    alt="{{ 'legalGuarantee.alt' | trans }}"
    width="1200" height="1697" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
  >
  <figcaption class="sr-only">{{ 'legalGuarantee.text' | trans | safe }}</figcaption>
</figure>
